    "body": "In this bonus episode, BioSpace Vice President of Marketing Chantal Dresner and Angela Gabriel, content manager, life sciences careers, discuss how the job market shaped up in Q3 and what Q4 might hold.\n> Listen on Spotify > Listen on Apple Podcasts > Listen on Amazon Music > Listen on iHeart\nBioSpace Vice President Chantal Dresner and Angela Gabriel, content manager, life sciences careers, cover what happened in the biopharma job market during the third quarter. They discuss encouraging signs for those looking for their next opportunity, such as improved job postings live on the BioSpace website and a dramatic drop in layoffs.\nOther topics include signs of industry health, news about job opportunities and advice for the Q4 job hunt.",
